@startuml
title FR-01 - Register Blood Bank - Activity Diagram

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond

|Network Administrator|
start
:Request registration of a blood bank;

|Client|
:Display the required registration fields;

|Network Administrator|
:Enter bank details, location,\nand approved contact information;

if (Administrator action?) then ([Submit])
  :Click the submit button;

  |Server — Organizations|
  :Check that the data is valid and complete;

  if (Data valid\nand complete?) then ([Yes])
    :Save the blood bank record;

    |Client|
    :Display registration confirmation;
    stop

  else ([No])
    |Client|
    :Display the fields requiring correction;
    stop
  endif

else ([Cancel])
  |Network Administrator|
  :Cancel registration before saving;
  stop
endif

@enduml